<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to auction 3.0 bln pesos of Cetes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico said it would auction 3.0 billion pesos worth of Cetes at the primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	   Fixed rates:</p>
<p>    27  days     800 million pesos  20.27 pct</p>
<p>    91  days     800 million pesos  20.27 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     800 million pesos  19.74 pct</p>
<p>    364 days     600 million pesos  19.04 pct</p>
<p>The central bank said it will also offer 900 million pesos worth of 727-day Bondes.</p>
<p>It will also offer 500 million UDIs worth of 1,092-day UDI bonds, and 250 million UDIs worth of 1,778-day UDI bonds.</p>
<p>((-- Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom 525 7289559))</p>
</text>
